pcb-kit
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source: https://github.com/somebox/pcb-kit, commit 32867ca.

Ported files (each carries a header naming its origin):

- src/pino_kernel/outline.py (outline_points and its helpers, from pcbkit/mech.py)
- src/pino_kernel/placement/ratsnest.py (from pcbkit/placement.py)
- src/pino_kernel/diff.py (from pcbkit/release/versions.py)
- src/pino_kernel/pcb/cleanup.py (EPS, key, collinear, within and plan, from pcbkit/checks/cleanup_tracks.py)

