KiCadRoutingTools
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The router pino runs: a grid-based autorouter for KiCad boards, with a Rust core.

Source: https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools, tag v0.17.7
(commit bc48cce8ac603d5300b24eebddd993098a20d0e4).

pino does not include its code. On first use pino fetches it at that commit
into the user cache (<cache>/krt/), with the release's prebuilt router core,
and runs its scripts as separate programs.

